# Arabic feature guide

`FEATURES_AR.md` is the Arabic explanation of every visitor- and owner-facing feature.

When a change adds, removes, or changes a feature someone can see or use (pages, filters, booking, accounts, listings, payments, areas, copy that changes behavior), update `FEATURES_AR.md` in the same change.

- Write the guide in Arabic, in the same sections and plain style already used there.
- Describe what the person can do and what is stored only on this device. Do not describe implementation files.
- If a feature is removed, delete it from the guide. Do not leave a stale step.
- Skip the update for internal refactors that do not change what people can do.
